  Scenario Outline: An amount out of its limits is rejected
    When I check a "money" with:
      | amount_minor   | currency   |
      | <amount_minor> | <currency> |
    Then the value is rejected by "<rule>" of "<definition>"

    Examples:
      | rule    | definition   | amount_minor | currency |
      | minimum | amount_minor | -1           | USD      |
      | enum    | currency     | 100          | JPY      |

  Scenario: An amount of 0 is accepted
    When I check a "money" with:
      | amount_minor | currency |
      | 0            | EUR      |
    Then the value is accepted

