  Scenario Outline: A state or a verdict out of its choices is rejected
    When I check a "<object>" with:
      | <property> |
      | <value>    |
    Then the value is rejected by "enum" of "<property>"

    Examples:
      | object       | property      | value |
      | hold_state   | hold_status   | LOST  |
      | ticket_state | ticket_status | LOST  |
      | entry_result | verdict       | MAYBE |

